    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nO'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers are delighted to offer for sale this turn-key condition apartment in the popular Gleann na Mona development in Knocknacarra.\n\nIdeally situated just off the Ballymoneen Road, Gleann na Mona is a residential development constructed in recent years offering modern quality living & an already established community with a spacious central green. \n\nSituated in a secured complex with allocated garage parking & lift service, no.103 Gleann na Mona is a mid-level upper floor apartment in excellent condition. \n\nThe A2 rated property is well proportioned with approximately 77.3 sq.m. \n\nThe accommodation consists of two double bedrooms, both with fitted wardrobes & one availing of its own en-suite, a main bathroom, an open-plan kitchen-reception space with floor-to-ceiling window, storage/hot-press, a separate utility and an adjacent balcony space. \n\nThe complex is well managed with lift-service & security door pedestrian access via the sheltered garage & Western Distributor Road. \n\nThe area is well serviced for local amenities within walking distance such as Gateway Retail Park & Cappagh Fields, whilst quality transport links give easy access to city centre & surrounding areas. \n\nThe property will be ideal for investment or owner occupiers alike. \n\nViewing is highly recommended.\n\nProperties can be viewed on our website www.odj.ie \n\nKeep up to-date with NEW PROPERTIES by registering your details on our database.\n\nFor Further details please contact O'Donnellan & Joyce on 091-564212 \nOFFICE OPENING HOURS - MON TO FRI 9AM TO 5:30PM\n\nNOTE: These particulars are not to be considered a formal offer. They are for information only and give a general idea of the property. They are not to be taken as forming any part of a resulting contract, nor to be relied upon as statements or representations of fact.\n\nFLOORPLANS: The floor plan including furniture, fixture measurements and dimensions are approximate and for illustrative purposes only. The Polycam App used gives no guarantee, warranty or representation as to the accuracy and layout. All enquiries must be directed to the agent.\n\nWhilst every care is taken in their preparation, neither O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers nor the vendor accept any liability as to their accuracy. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by personal inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of these particulars.\n\nNo person in the employment of O'Donnellan & Joyce Auctioneers has any authority to make or give any representation or warranty whatever in relation to this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Turn-key condition with A2 rating</li><li> Spacious apartment</li><li> Two-bed/two-bath with private balcony</li><li> Owner occupied</li><li> Popular residential development</li><li> Sheltered garage with allocated parking space</li><li> Lift service & security door access</li><li> Large communal green in centre of development</li><li> Walking distance to a host of amenities</ul>"
